            "description": "POST /logout — PUBLIC in main.go (no AuthMiddleware) but requires existing `token` cookie: 401 {\"error\":\"not authenticated\"} if missing; else 200 {\"message\":\"logout successful\"} and clears cookie. Send with cookie jar after login."
